OL,4,CLong-lost Chevalier landscape found in 
OL,5,Ccharity shop                           
OL,6,GA rediscovered 19th Century oil        
OL,7,Gpainting bought for #20 in a charity   
OL,8,Gshop could be auctioned for up to      
OL,9,G#20,000.                               
OL,11,FCape Schanck, Victoria, by Russian-    
OL,12,FSwiss artist Nicholas Chevalier, was   
OL,13,Fdiscovered in a charity shop in        
OL,14,FMaidenhead, Berkshire.                 
OL,16,FIt was brought to the attention of     
OL,17,FAdrian Biddell at London's Olympia     
OL,18,FAuctions, who established the painting 
OL,19,Fwas a Chevalier work that had been     
OL,20,Fmissing for 160 years.                 
